.superpowers/

# Generated datasets: the full two-year set is ~250 MB, regenerate with
#   go run ./cmd/lapdog-gen -dir .dataset
.dataset/
.dataset.db
.dataset.db-wal
.dataset.db-shm

# Build output. Rebuild with `make build-ctl`, `make build-gen`, `make build-windows`.
# Note: not "*.lpd" — the committed capture fixtures under testdata/fixtures must
# stay tracked, since tests and reviewers depend on them.
#
# Anchored to the repository root, so it means only this directory. An unanchored
# "dist/" matches a directory of that name at any depth, which also caught
# internal/web/dist below.
/dist/

# The frontend bundle: generated by `make ui`, built by CI, never committed. It is
# about a megabyte of minified JavaScript that changes wholesale on every UI edit.
#
# .gitkeep is tracked deliberately. //go:embed all:dist fails at compile time if
# the pattern matches nothing, so without a tracked file in this directory every
# Go build on a clean clone breaks — including `go vet` and builds that never
# serve the interface.
internal/web/dist/*
!internal/web/dist/.gitkeep
